# Caching Rules (4 Rules)

## 8. Static Assets
Cache /_astro/* for 1 year immutable. Other public files 1 day to 1 week. HTML NOT cached.

## 9. No Cloudflare HTML Cache
No Cache Everything on HTML unless purge-on-deploy configured.

## 10. Sanity Webhook Rebuild
Site is static. Sanity publish calls a Vercel Deploy Hook that rebuilds pages and sitemap. Content updates without developer.

## 11. Test Auto-Update
Before launch: Edit in Sanity, publish, verify production updates after the rebuild (about 2 minutes).
